pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115993","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115993","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115993.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115993.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-09T21:20:32Z"},"body":"- Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112038\r\n- Related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113039\r\n- Related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113165\r\n\r\n# Issue Description\r\n\r\nAs mentioned in #113039, It is possible to rellocate memory when auto growing using `AHashMap`. So we shouldnot using `AHashMap` to store reference.\r\n\r\nAnd as metioned in  [the comments of #113039](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113039#pullrequestreview-3503262891). We decided to keep `AHashMap` to improve performance and let `AHashMap` store `animation_name` except the reference of animation.\r\n\r\n# Test Cases\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112038#issuecomment-3541837783\r\n\r\n[anim-map-crash-1.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/894d1176-01ad-4fbf-96d0-d090152583f1)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113165#issue-3664653936\r\n\r\n[anim-map-crash-2.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c5f8f93-1e85-4707-b90e-aeda9a822403)\r\n\r\n# Etc\r\n\r\nAfter testing some projects, I find we need not check `animation_name` equals `stop`.  Please give me some suggestions. @TokageItLab ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.